records.english:
al-Rushāṭī reported from Abū ʿUbaydah ibn al-Muthannā that he was one of the delegation of ʿAbd al-Qays who came with al-Ashajj. Wathīma mentioned from Ibn Isḥāq that he showed the Muslims the vulnerable point of the people of the fortress in Bahrain. He related the account and quoted verses by him, including:

Do not threaten us with Maghrūr and his household;
whoever encounters us meets from us the custom of al-Ḥuṭam.
